WEBVTT

41:06.490 --> 41:07.575
Uncle Benjen.

41:08.784 --> 41:10.453
(LAUGHS)

41:10.578 --> 41:11.787
You got bigger.

41:13.164 --> 41:14.749
Rode all day.

41:14.874 --> 41:17.460
Didn't want to leave you alone
with the Lannisters.

41:17.585 --> 41:18.919
Why aren't you at the feast?

41:19.045 --> 41:21.797
Lady Stark thought it might
insult the royal family

41:21.922 --> 41:23.841
to seat a bastard in their midst.

41:24.675 --> 41:27.053
Well, you're always
welcome on the Wall.

41:27.178 --> 41:29.138
No bastard was ever
refused a seat there.

41:29.263 --> 41:30.973
So take me with you
when you go back.
